{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"5915","title":"Xiaomi SU7 Ultra Hits the Virtual Track in Gran Turismo 7","desc":"Flagship performance EV debuts in legendary racing simulator, marking a new milestone for automotive excellence on the global stage.","view_cnt":"4519","like_cnt":"3","add_time":"1769510961","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/840_operatorx_operatorx_opx/28/01/2026/5c1053f412e9c61f81917635adfcb328.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, January 28, 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e– Xiaomi and renowned video game developer Polyphony Digital Inc., a subsidiary of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc., today announced that Xiaomi SU7 Ultra will launch in the acclaimed racing simulation game\u0026nbsp;\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e\u0026nbsp;on PlayStation®4 and PlayStation®5 platforms, beginning January 29, 2026. The vehicle will debut as part of the upcoming “Update 1.67” patch, marking the brand’s landmark first entry into the storied\u0026nbsp;\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo\u003c/em\u003e\u0026nbsp;franchise. Following the update’s release at 2:00 PM (GMT+8), players worldwide will be able to experience the prowess of this high-performance luxury car on the game's virtual tracks.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/358_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/01/2026/718e864197068330b8602b6290f49d97.png\" alt=\"A vibrant promotional image features a yellow sports car prominently displayed. The text indicates that the Xiaomi SU7 Ultra will be available on January 29 in Gran Turismo 7. The background transitions from blue to red, enhancing the dynamic feel of the advertisement.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs a benchmark in racing simulations, the\u0026nbsp;\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo\u003c/em\u003e\u0026nbsp;series is globally recognized for its hyper-realistic driving experience and stringent vehicle selection criteria, with a historical focus on classic performance models from established global brands. The collaboration between Xiaomi and Polyphony Digital was officially announced on June 7, 2025. With its exceptional performance and technological innovation, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra represents a new addition to the\u0026nbsp;\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo\u0026nbsp;\u003c/em\u003eseries’ carefully curated vehicle lineup, drawing attention from players and automotive enthusiasts worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKazunori Yamauchi, Producer of the\u0026nbsp;\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo\u003c/em\u003e\u0026nbsp;series, test-drove Xiaomi SU7 Ultra on multiple occasions at locations including Beijing, the Nürburgring Nordschleife, and Tsukuba Circuit, engaging in in-depth exchanges with Xiaomi Auto executives and engineering teams. To faithfully recreate the authentic experience of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra for global players, both teams dedicated themselves to building a highly precise digital vehicle model in the game. Through professional technical processes, they ensure the virtual car maintains extreme consistency with its physical model. To achieve this, Xiaomi Auto’s vehicle dynamics performance team specifically traveled to Polyphony Digital’s studio in Fukuoka to participate in the final driving experience validation, ensuring the in-game rendition accurately captures the dynamics of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/791_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/01/2026/67e3117cd2c792ff91fa6f501637e343.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra is powered by an in-house developed Dual V8s + V6s Xiaomi Hyper Tri-Motor system, delivering a combined maximum output of 1,548 horsepower and 1,770 N·m of torque. Coupled with an 800V high-voltage platform, it achieves supercar-level acceleration from 0-100 km/h in 1.98 seconds (without one-foot rollout). The vehicle features a double-wishbone front suspension, a five-link rear suspension, and dual-chamber air springs paired with high-performance adaptive dampers, striking a balance between ultimate handling and ride comfort. It offers a CLTC range of 630 km and supports fast charging from 10% to 80% in just 11 minutes, achieving a perfect equilibrium between performance and practicality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs the high-performance flagship of Xiaomi Auto, the production version of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra first challenged the Nürburgring Nordschleife on April 1, 2025. Equipped with the optional Track Package, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra set a blistering lap time of 7:04.957, decisively breaking the record for electric executive vehicles on the Nürburgring Nordschleife. This milestone achievement stems from a relentless pursuit of track performance, enabled by a top-tier electric powertrain system, chassis torque vectoring control, and advanced aerodynamic design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/286_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/01/2026/1482222e0de719c93280293289711020.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePreviously, Xiaomi Group Founder, Chairman, and CEO Lei Jun expressed his great pleasure that Xiaomi SU7 Ultra was selected for inclusion in\u0026nbsp;\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e, looking forward to allowing more\u0026nbsp;\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e\u0026nbsp;players and automotive culture enthusiasts to appreciate the charm of high-performance smart vehicles from Xiaomi Auto.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn 2025, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra was also showcased in multiple countries and regions, including Spain, Singapore, Japan, and Berlin, receiving acclaim from global automotive professionals and enthusiasts. As Xiaomi Auto advances its global strategy, this performance vehicle, blending power with intelligence, is conveying its technological confidence and appeal on both virtual and real-world tracks. To celebrate the launch, Polyphony Digital will host a two-week official lap-time challenge on the historic Monza circuit in\u0026nbsp;\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e, inviting players worldwide to compete using Xiaomi SU7 Ultra.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/730_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/01/2026/f679bf6294624ccd02dfbced118e1d7a.png\" alt=\"An image shows a yellow car named Xiaomi SU7 Ultra '25 parked on the Autodromo Nazionale Monza track. The background features spectator stands and a blue sky, with the text mentioning \u0026quot;Lap Time Challenge.\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eImages and videos available here:\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgCYOkvi50LrQ7TxB3y2sAy1AY0Tbh8Ab7CL9LoTTBHxack?e=xOissE\"\u003eXiaomi x Gran Turismo 7\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In September 2025, the MAU reached approximately 741.7 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 1,035.5 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of September 30, 2025. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2025, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the seventh year in a row, ranking 297th.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Polyphony Digital\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(100, 37, 208);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInc. and Gran Turismo\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGran Turismo is a video game developed by Polyphony Digital Inc., a subsidiary of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc. Having launched in Japan first in 1997, the multi-award-winning franchise is regarded as the best and most authentic driving simulator due to true-to-life graphics, authentic physics technology and careful attention to detail. Polyphony and its famed creator Kazunori Yamauchi have revolutionized the racing game genre.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease visit at\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.gran-turismo.com\"\u003ehttps://www.gran-turismo.com\u003c/a\u003e ｜ \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.polyphony.co.jp/\"\u003ehttps://www.polyphony.co.jp/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"894","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1769605242"},"common":null}